  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-walls\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e67e23\">對角牆壁</span></a></h1>\n<p>This is just a very simple mod for Better Minecraft 4 to fix some of the broken walls added by diagonal walls.</p>\n<p>Done so by overriding them with new walls.</p>\n<p>The specific walls it fixes are the&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><a style=\"color:#c2e0f4\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether</a> </span>Aerogel wall</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-redux\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Redux</a></span> polished sentrite wall</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quarks&nbsp;</a></span>Mylite and Mylite Bricks walls</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
